Topic: CD015751
Version: base
Title: Lubricating drops for contact lens discomfort in adults
Year: 2023

Date: 2023-05-24

Abstract:
Objectives This is a protocol for a Cochrane Review (intervention). The objectives are as follows:
To determine the efficacy and safety of lubricating drops for ocular discomfort associated with
contact lens wear in adults.

